          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Dean E. Maynard (Amicus Curiae for United States), according to Dean E. Maynard (Amicus Curiae for United States), the dispute centers on whether the case presents a justiciable case or controversy under Article\u202fIII of the Constitution."
