              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to John G. Kester, the petitioner asserts that the contract claim is clear in the record and that the precedent Harvey Steel, relied upon by the respondents, has been overruled."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. MAYNARD",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "797774137e8c3cf1953e98afb88a76a882d4c2d1de71f44646954ade4048a94e",
