              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. MAYNARD, the petitioner contends that the licensee does not need to breach the licensing agreement to create a case or controversy and is paying royalties it believes it does not owe."
        }
      ],
